{"seq":2,"slug":"openapi-contract-first","title":"OpenAPI 3.1 与契约驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations/openapi-contract-first","wordCount":1039,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"openapi-3-1-与契约驱动开发\">OpenAPI 3.1 与契约驱动开发</h1><p>&quot;先写规范再写代码&quot;——这句话在 2026 年已从理想主义变为工程标配。OpenAPI 3.1 完全对齐 JSON Schema 2020-12，消除了历史遗留的 <code>nullable</code> 与 <code>example</code> 歧义，让同一份 Schema 能同时服务于 REST API 定义、AI 工具调用（Function Calling）和配置校验。当规范文件成为唯一事实源（Single Source of Truth），文档漂移、客户端 codegen 滞后、集成意外等问题才能被系统性消除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>契约驱动开发（Contract-First Development）将 API 生命周期倒转：传统是&quot;实现 → 生成文档&quot;，contract-first 是&quot;定义契约 → 生成代码/文档/Mock/测试&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[设计阶段] --&gt; B[OpenAPI Spec]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Mock Server]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Server Stubs]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Client SDK]&#10;    B --&gt; F[文档站点]&#10;    B --&gt; G[契约测试]&#10;    C --&gt; H[前端并行开发]&#10;    D --&gt; I[后端实现]&#10;    G --&gt; J[CI 门禁]\">graph LR\n    A[设计阶段] --&gt; B[OpenAPI Spec]\n    B --&gt; C[Mock Server]\n    B --&gt; D[Server Stubs]\n    B --&gt; E[Client SDK]\n    B --&gt; F[文档站点]\n    B --&gt; G[契约测试]\n    C --&gt; H[前端并行开发]\n    D --&gt; I[后端实现]\n    G --&gt; J[CI 门禁]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Code-First</th>\n<th>Contract-First</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规范产出时机</td>\n<td>实现之后（副产物）</td>\n<td>实现之前（真理源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档准确性</td>\n<td>容易漂移</td>\n<td>始终同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前后端并行度</td>\n<td>低（需等后端实现）</td>\n<td>高（Mock 即刻可用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破坏性变更检测</td>\n<td>上线后发现</td>\n<td>设计阶段拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队协作质量</td>\n<td>依赖口头约定</td>\n<td>依赖版本化契约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>快速原型、内部工具</td>\n<td>公共 API、多团队协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"openapi-3-1-的关键能力\">OpenAPI 3.1 的关键能力</h2><h3 id=\"完整的-json-schema-2020-12-支持\">完整的 JSON Schema 2020-12 支持</h3><p>OpenAPI 3.1 之前，Schema 是 JSON Schema 的一个&quot;方言&quot;——有微妙差异。3.1 消除了所有差异，意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>$ref</code> 可以指向任何位置，不再有限制</li>\n<li>支持 <code>if/then/else</code>、<code>oneOf/anyOf/allOf</code> 的完整组合</li>\n<li><code>type</code> 可以是数组（如 <code>&quot;type&quot;: [&quot;string&quot;, &quot;null&quot;]</code>），取代了旧的 <code>nullable: true</code></li>\n<li><code>examples</code> 支持多个示例（取代单数 <code>example</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"openapi: 3.1.0&#10;info:&#10;  title: Orders API&#10;  version: 2.0.0&#10;paths:&#10;  /orders:&#10;    post:&#10;      operationId: createOrder&#10;      requestBody:&#10;        required: true&#10;        content:&#10;          application/json:&#10;            schema:&#10;              $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/NewOrder&#39;&#10;      responses:&#10;        &#39;201&#39;:&#10;          description: 订单创建成功&#10;          headers:&#10;            Location:&#10;              schema:&#10;                type: string&#10;                format: uri&#10;          content:&#10;            application/json:&#10;              schema:&#10;                $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/Order&#39;&#10;        &#39;422&#39;:&#10;          $ref: &#39;#/components/responses/ValidationError&#39;&#10;&#10;components:&#10;  schemas:&#10;    Order:&#10;      type: object&#10;      required: [id, customerId, status, items]&#10;      properties:&#10;        id:&#10;          type: string&#10;          format: uuid&#10;        customerId:&#10;          type: string&#10;          format: uuid&#10;        status:&#10;          type: string&#10;          enum: [pending, confirmed, shipped, delivered, cancelled]&#10;        items:&#10;          type: array&#10;          items:&#10;            $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/OrderItem&#39;&#10;          minItems: 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">openapi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Orders API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  /orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">createOrder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      requestBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/schemas/NewOrder'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      responses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '201'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">订单创建成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">uri</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/schemas/Order'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '422'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/responses/ValidationError'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">components</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schemas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">uuid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        customerId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">uuid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pending</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">confirmed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">shipped</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">delivered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cancelled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">array</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/schemas/OrderItem'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          minItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模块化与-ref-复用\">模块化与 $ref 复用</h3><p>成熟的 API 项目将 Schema 拆分为独立文件，通过 <code>$ref</code> 引用组装。这让大型 API 团队可以独立维护各自域的 Schema，CI 流水线通过 <code>bundle</code> 命令合并为发布版本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"security-schemes\">Security Schemes</h3><p>OpenAPI 3.1 内置对 OAuth 2.0、Bearer Token、API Key、OpenID Connect 的描述能力，让安全策略成为契约的一部分，而非实现细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"contract-first-工作流\">Contract-First 工作流</h2><p>成熟团队的 contract-first 工作流分六步：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：需求发现</strong> — 识别消费者、用例、SLA、错误处理需求。画出资源模型与关系图。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步：起草契约</strong> — 用 OpenAPI 3.1 定义路径、Schema、Examples。工具推荐：Stoplight Studio（可视化编辑）、Redocly CLI（lint + bundle）。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步：评审与迭代</strong> — 运行 Spectral 等 lint 规则检查命名一致性、安全配置、破坏性变更。进行设计评审。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步：Mock 与前端并行</strong> — 从 Spec 直接生成 Mock Server（Prism/Microcks），前端团队即刻开始集成开发，无需等待后端实现。</p>\n<p><strong>第五步：实现与 codegen</strong> — 后端团队从 Spec 生成服务端 stubs（OpenAPI Generator / Speakeasy），填充业务逻辑。客户端 SDK 同步生成。</p>\n<p><strong>第六步：CI 门禁与发布</strong> — 契约测试进 CI，任何不兼容变更阻断部署。发布后通过 changelog 通知消费者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的工具链生态\">2026 年的工具链生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Stoplight Studio</td>\n<td>可视化设计</td>\n<td>所见即所得的 OpenAPI 编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spectral</td>\n<td>Lint 规则引擎</td>\n<td>自定义规则集，安全/命名/一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prism</td>\n<td>Mock Server</td>\n<td>从 Spec 自动生成符合 Schema 的响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redocly CLI</td>\n<td>Bundle + 文档</td>\n<td>多文件合并 + 交互式文档渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenAPI Generator</td>\n<td>Codegen</td>\n<td>50+ 语言的 Client/Server stubs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Speakeasy</td>\n<td>高质量 SDK</td>\n<td>生成符合各语言惯例的 SDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buf</td>\n<td>Protobuf 工具链</td>\n<td>gRPC 世界的 &quot;OpenAPI Generator&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"json-schema-在-ai-工具调用中的角色\">JSON Schema 在 AI 工具调用中的角色</h2><p>2026 年一个重要趋势：OpenAI、Anthropic、Google 的 Function Calling / Tool Use 全部使用 JSON Schema 子集来定义工具参数。这意味着一份精心设计的 OpenAPI Schema 可以直接复用为 AI Agent 的工具定义——API 设计能力与 AI Agent 可调用性实现了统一。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;createOrder&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;创建一个新订单&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parameters&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;    &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;customerId&quot;, &quot;items&quot;],&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;customerId&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;format&quot;: &quot;uuid&quot; },&#10;      &quot;items&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;array&quot;,&#10;        &quot;items&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;          &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;sku&quot;, &quot;quantity&quot;],&#10;          &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;sku&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot; },&#10;            &quot;quantity&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;integer&quot;, &quot;minimum&quot;: 1 }&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"createOrder\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"创建一个新订单\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customerId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"customerId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"uuid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"array\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minimum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>OpenAPI 3.1 完全对齐 JSON Schema 2020-12，消除了历史方言差异</li>\n<li>Contract-First 将规范提升为唯一事实源，驱动 codegen/mock/test/doc 全链路</li>\n<li>六步工作流：需求 → 起草 → 评审 → Mock → 实现 → CI 门禁</li>\n<li>JSON Schema 同时服务 REST API 定义与 AI Function Calling，一份 Schema 两处复用</li>\n<li>工具链已高度成熟：Spectral lint + Prism mock + Speakeasy codegen 覆盖全流程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"paradigm-selection\">API 范式选型</a> — 理解四大范式的定位与适用场景</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/frontend-data-fetching/foundations/server-vs-client-state\">前端数据获取：服务端状态与客户端状态</a> — 从消费者视角看 API 数据如何被管理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenAPI 3.1 与契约驱动开发","id":"openapi-3-1-与契约驱动开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenAPI 3.1 的关键能力","id":"openapi-3-1-的关键能力"},{"level":3,"text":"完整的 JSON Schema 2020-12 支持","id":"完整的-json-schema-2020-12-支持"},{"level":3,"text":"模块化与 $ref 复用","id":"模块化与-ref-复用"},{"level":3,"text":"Security Schemes","id":"security-schemes"},{"level":2,"text":"Contract-First 工作流","id":"contract-first-工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的工具链生态","id":"2026-年的工具链生态"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON Schema 在 AI 工具调用中的角色","id":"json-schema-在-ai-工具调用中的角色"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"API 范式选型：REST、GraphQL、gRPC 与 tRPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations/paradigm-selection"},"next":{"title":"RESTful 资源建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/foundations/resource-modeling"}}